  "description": "3-phase power analyzer, Modbus RTU. 32-bit registers (2 words each, addr+=2 per entry). Measurements at addr 0-52: L1-L2/L2-L3/L3-L1 line voltages, L1-N/L2-N/L3-N phase voltages (×0.01 V), L1/L2/L3/N currents (×0.001 A), total+per-phase active/reactive/apparent power (×0.01 W/VAr/VA), power factor L1/L2/L3/total (×0.001), frequency (×0.01 Hz). Min/max/demand and energy counters (import/export active, inductive/capacitive reactive × 2 tariffs) at higher addresses. Setpoints (up to 10) at 0x8000 (32768): activation, parameter type, high/low set, fail/recovery delay, hysteresis, output, parameter (8 registers each).",
